        ],
        "recommendation": "The only content is `TrashIcon`, whose `<svg>` is `aria-hidden=\"true\"` (src/components/icons.tsx), so the control has no text at all: a screen reader user reaching it hears nothing (or \"button\" once it is a button) and cannot tell it deletes the document. Give the button a name, e.g. `aria-label=\"Delete document\"` or visually hidden text. WCAG 1.1.1 Non-text Content, 4.1.2 Name, Role, Value.",
